description:
Look up HTTP status codes: meaning, defining RFC section (RFC 9110 and others from the IANA registry), when to send it and common pitfalls. Pass a code (404), a class (5xx) or words (rate limit). Unofficial nginx and Cloudflare codes are included and flagged.

Returns: JSON { query, count, results[] } where each result has { code, name, class, spec, official, deprecated, cacheableByDefault, summary, usage, note }, plus unknownCode text when a 3-digit code is not registered.
Example input: {"query":"429"}
